Package: bcachefs-updatedb
Version: 0.0.0-replaced-by-makefile
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: replaced-by-makefile
Maintainer: Jérôme Poulin <jeromepoulin@gmail.com>
Description: updatedb for bcachefs, reading the dirents btree
 Streams the dirents btree out of the running kernel and writes a plocate
 database from it, instead of walking the filesystem with readdir and stat.
